[00:04:36.267] Browser LOG     Binding products. Profile Fit: [] Available Products: [{"description":"**GrokHR – Human Resource Management System**\n\n**Short Tagline / One-Liner**\nTransform your HR processes from chaos to clarity – saving time, reducing costs, and empowering your people.\n\n**Overview**\nGrokHR is a cloud-based HRMS designed for small to mid-sized businesses, offering end-to-end HR management from recruitment to retirement. It automates routine tasks, ensures compliance, and provides actionable insights to help you build a stronger workforce.\n\n**Key Features**\n- Automated payroll processing with tax compliance\n- Employee self-service portal for leave, claims, and profile updates\n- Recruitment module with applicant tracking and onboarding workflows\n- Performance management with goal setting and reviews\n- Analytics dashboard with real-time HR metrics\n- Mobile app for employees and managers\n- Integration with popular tools (e.g., accounting software, email)\n\n**How Clients Benefit (Key Value Points)**\n- **Save Time & Reduce Admin Work**: Automate repetitive tasks like payroll and leave approvals, freeing up to 60% of HR team time for strategic initiatives.\n- **Cut Costs**: Eliminate errors in payroll and compliance penalties, typically reducing HR operational costs by 30-40%.\n- **Faster Hiring**: Streamline recruitment with automated tracking, shortening time-to-hire by up to 50%.\n- **Boost Employee Engagement**: Self-service portal and transparent performance tools improve satisfaction and retention rates by 20-25%.\n- **Data-Driven Decisions**: Real-time analytics help identify trends, reduce turnover, and optimize workforce planning.\n\n**Real Results from Clients**\n- \"A mid-sized tech firm reduced payroll processing time from 3 days to 4 hours and saved $45,000 annually in admin costs.\"\n- \"Manufacturing client cut employee turnover by 18% in the first year through better performance tracking and feedback.\"\n- \"Retail chain of 500 employees improved compliance audit scores from 72% to 98%.\"\n\n**Why Choose GrokHR?**\n- Intuitive interface with minimal training required\n- Scalable pricing – grow without outgrowing the system\n- 24/7 local support and dedicated implementation team\n- Regular updates with no extra cost\n\n**Call to Action**\nReady to modernize your HR and see these results in your organization? Book a free demo today and discover how GrokHR can work for you!","filePaths":["/uploads/1765372373508_a.png","/uploads/1767198544052_cbfe0684.txt"],"id":"6939718948cf39a9f5483e55","imagePath":"uploads//6939718948cf39a9f5483e55/6939718948cf39a9f5483e55_1769529460064.jpg","name":"GrokHR – Human Resource Management System","status":"FILE_UPLOADED","userId":"697764ae603d3a0c15064518"},{"description":"Short Tagline / One-Liner\n\nGain full control of your fleet operations – reduce fuel costs, improve delivery speed, and ensure real-time visibility.\n\nOverview\n\nTrackify360 is a cloud-based logistics and fleet management platform built for transport companies, e-commerce businesses, and supply chain operators. It provides real-time vehicle tracking, route optimization, driver performance monitoring, and delivery management – all in one centralized dashboard. The platform helps businesses reduce operational costs, improve on-time deliveries, and enhance customer satisfaction.\n\nKey Features\n\nReal-time GPS tracking of vehicles and shipments\n\nRoute optimization with traffic-aware navigation\n\nFuel consumption and mileage monitoring\n\nDriver behavior analytics (speeding, harsh braking, idle time)\n\nDigital proof of delivery (POD) with e-signature and photo upload\n\nMaintenance scheduling and service reminders\n\nCentralized dashboard with live alerts and reports\n\nMobile app for drivers and delivery teams\n\nIntegration with ERP, warehouse management, and invoicing systems\n\nHow Clients Benefit (Key Value Points)\n\nReduce Fuel & Operational Costs\nSmart routing and fuel monitoring help cut fuel expenses by up to 25–35%.\n\nImprove Delivery Efficiency\nOptimized routes and real-time tracking reduce delivery delays and increase on-time delivery rates by 40–50%.\n\nEnhance Fleet Safety\nDriver behavior insights reduce accidents and insurance claims by 20–30%.\n\nBetter Customer Experience\nLive shipment tracking and delivery notifications improve transparency and customer satisfaction scores by 30%.\n\nData-Driven Decision Making\nAnalytics dashboards provide actionable insights on fleet utilization, downtime, and performance trends.\n\nReal Results from Clients\n\n\"A logistics company with 120 vehicles reduced monthly fuel costs by ₹8 lakhs within 6 months of implementation.\"\n\n\"An e-commerce delivery partner improved on-time deliveries from 78% to 96%.\"\n\n\"A regional transport operator reduced vehicle breakdowns by 35% through predictive maintenance alerts.\"\n\nWhy Choose Trackify360?\n\nEasy-to-use interface with minimal training required\n\nScalable architecture suitable for 10 to 10,000+ vehicles\n\nHigh-accuracy GPS tracking with low latency updates\n\nSecure cloud infrastructure with data encryption\n\n24/7 technical support and onboarding assistance\n\nCustomizable reports and dashboards\n\nCall to Action\n\nReady to optimize your fleet operations and reduce logistics costs?\nBook a free demo today and experience how Trackify360 can transform your logistics business! 🚚📊","filePaths":["uploads//69776569603d3a0c15064519/1769432426193_5d02c844.svg"],"id":"69776569603d3a0c15064519","imagePath":"uploads//69776569603d3a0c15064519/69776569603d3a0c15064519_1769834929170.svg","name":"Trackify360 – Smart Logistics & Fleet Management Platform.","status":"FILE_UPLOADED","userId":"697764ae603d3a0c15064518"},{"description":"Short Tagline / One-Liner\n\nPersonalized learning for every student – smarter, faster, and more effective education.\n\nOverview\n\nLearnSphere is a cloud-based EdTech platform designed for schools, colleges, coaching institutes, and online educators. It uses AI-driven personalization to adapt learning content based on each student’s performance, learning speed, and interests. The platform combines virtual classrooms, assessments, progress tracking, and analytics to deliver a complete digital learning ecosystem.\n\nKey Features\n\nAI-based personalized learning paths\n\nLive virtual classrooms with recording and playback\n\nInteractive course builder for teachers\n\nSmart assessments with auto-grading\n\nAdaptive quizzes based on student performance\n\nStudent progress tracking and performance analytics\n\nGamification (badges, leaderboards, achievements)\n\nParent dashboard for performance monitoring\n\nMobile apps for students and educators\n\nIntegration with LMS, Google Classroom, and payment gateways\n\nHow Clients Benefit (Key Value Points)\n\nImproved Learning Outcomes\nPersonalized study plans increase concept retention by up to 40%.\n\nSave Teacher Time\nAutomated grading and reporting reduce manual work by 50–60%.\n\nHigher Student Engagement\nGamified learning increases course completion rates by 30–45%.\n\nBetter Performance Tracking\nReal-time analytics help identify weak areas early and improve exam results.\n\nScalable Online Education\nInstitutions can easily expand from offline to hybrid or fully online learning models.\n\nReal Results from Clients\n\n\"A coaching institute improved average student scores by 22% within one academic term.\"\n\n\"A private school reduced teacher admin workload by 55% using automated assessments.\"\n\n\"An online tutor increased student retention rate from 60% to 88%.\"\n\nWhy Choose LearnSphere?\n\nSimple and intuitive interface for all age groups\n\nAI-powered adaptive learning engine\n\nSupports multilingual content and regional languages\n\nSecure cloud-based infrastructure with data privacy compliance\n\nAffordable pricing for institutions of all sizes\n\nContinuous feature upgrades\n\nCall to Action\n\nReady to modernize education and deliver smarter learning experiences?\nBook a free demo today and see how LearnSphere can transform your classroom! 🎓🚀","filePaths":["uploads//69776593603d3a0c1506451a/1769432468737_ad90eebe.png","uploads//69776593603d3a0c1506451a/1769833840390_0a6ea901.png","uploads//69776593603d3a0c1506451a/1769834752045_2924f714.png"],"id":"69776593603d3a0c1506451a","imagePath":"uploads//69776593603d3a0c1506451a/69776593603d3a0c1506451a_1769833858917.png","name":"LearnSphere – AI-Powered Smart Learning Platform....","status":"FILE_UPLOADED","userId":"697764ae603d3a0c15064518"}]
