ation and deliver smarter learning experiences?\nBook a free demo today and see how LearnSphere can transform your classroom! 🎓🚀","filePaths":["uploads//69776593603d3a0c1506451a/1769432468737_ad90eebe.png","uploads//69776593603d3a0c1506451a/1769833840390_0a6ea901.png","uploads//69776593603d3a0c1506451a/1769834752045_2924f714.png"],"id":"69776593603d3a0c1506451a","imagePath":"uploads//69776593603d3a0c1506451a/69776593603d3a0c1506451a_1769833858917.png","name":"LearnSphere – AI-Powered Smart Learning Platform....","status":"FILE_UPLOADED","userId":"697764ae603d3a0c15064518"}]
